From u89c9fc822e34b78c at groups.google.com  Sun Dec 13 19:35:45 2015
From: u89c9fc822e34b78c at groups.google.com (yrosseel)
Date: Sun, 13 Dec 2015 19:35:45 +0000
Subject: Re: Continuous latent variables and binary dependent variables
Message-ID: <44q3DphAufk.rJYrPkEaAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <44q3DphAufk.PIZ9pbARAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <44q3DphAufk.DeKj-iSGDgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com> <44q3DphAufk.PIZ9pbARAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/44q3DphAufk/m/rJYrPkEaAwAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
